     "description": "In Florida\u2019s only series that went the full seven games, defenseman Seth Jones ignited the offense early in the second period, setting the tone for a dominant Panthers performance. Jumping into the rush, Jones carried the puck into the zone, looked off a pass, and rifled a shot far side for his third goal of the postseason.  \r\nJones was a cornerstone of the Panthers\u2019 success, leading the team in ice time with an average of over 25 minutes per game. His steady presence on the blue line and ability to contribute offensively were pivotal in helping Florida secure their second consecutive Stanley Cup championship.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
